WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 51f04781025bf1dbba2ded55c062926f

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.580
Karibu tena. Hadi sasa tunapounda variable,

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:06.560
tumekuwa tukitumia thamani rahisi tu; namba kama

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.620
50 au string kama yellow. Variable huwa

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:13.340
na nguvu zaidi sana tunapoweza

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.460
kuzitumia pamoja. Yaani

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:19.000
tunapoweza kusema kwamba ukingo wa kushoto wa

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.030
mstatili uwe umbali fulani kutoka

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:25.660
ukingo wa turubai. Katika kupanga programu,

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:28.810
tunaweza kutumia hesabu za kawaida na rahisi, kama kujumlisha,

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:32.340
kutoa, kuzidisha, na kugawanya, na tunaweza kutumia

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.140
variable tulizokwisha weka kama sehemu

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.020
ya hizo hesabu. Hebu tuanze kwa kusema

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.300
tunataka kuchora mstatili kwenye turubai yetu,

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:43.800
na tunataka uanze 10

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.980
kutoka kushoto na kutoka kulia, na

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.960
20 kutoka juu na kutoka chini.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.580
Kwa hiyo utakuwa katikati

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:53.900
ya turubai, ukiwa na upana mkubwa kidogo

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:57.740
kuliko urefu wake. Utakumbuka kwamba tunapochora

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:00.430
mstatili, tunahitaji kujua left, top,

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:02.510
width, na height yake, pamoja na rangi yake.

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:04.820
Kwa hiyo tunaweza kuanza kwa kuandika

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:08.320
hayo. Na sasa tunahitaji kufikiri kwa kweli

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.220
ni nini left, top, width, na height

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:13.100
yake. Hebu tuziweke. Left ni

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:15.660
20. Lo, samahani, left ni 10. Top ni

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:18.920
20. Na width, basi, width ni

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:22.020
ukubwa wa turubai, ambao ni 100, ukitoa

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:23.340
10 ya kushoto na 10

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:26.100
ya kulia, kwa hiyo ni 80. Na

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:29.040
height ni urefu wa turubai, ambao

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:31.580
pia ni 100, ukitoa 20 ya

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.660
juu na 20 ya chini, kwa hiyo

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.860
60. Kwa hiyo tunaweza kuweka variable hizo. Left,

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:42.840
10, top, 20, width, 80, height, 60. Na

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:44.880
natumaini hili linakufahamika vizuri. Ndicho

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:46.700
ambacho umekuwa ukifanya hadi sasa katika

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:50.940
mazoezi. Lakini nini kinatokea sasa ikiwa tunataka

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:54.140
kusogeza mstatili ndani kidogo, kuufanya

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:55.400
uwe mdogo kidogo? Ikiwa tunataka

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:57.040
kuusogeza 20 kutoka kushoto na

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:59.040
kulia na 30 kutoka juu na

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:02.620
chini? Inatubidi twende tukahesabu kila kitu

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:06.320
tena. Sasa width ni 100 toa

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:10.280
20 toa 20, na height ni 100

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:14.320
toa 30 toa 30, na kwa kweli hii ni

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:17.280
kazi na hesabu nyingi kuliko ninavyotaka

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:20.400
kufanya. Kwa hiyo badala yake, tunaweza kuiambia

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:24.000
kompyuta ifanye hivyo kwa ajili yetu. Tunaweza

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:27.680
kuweka width kuwa 100 toa

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:31.620
left toa left, na height

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:34.720
kuwa 100 toa top toa top,

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:37.580
kwa sababu juu na chini ni sawa. Au

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:40.980
tunaweza kuandika hiyo kama 100 toa

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:44.820
left mara mbili, au 100 toa

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:48.620
top mara mbili. Na sasa tukibadilisha

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:52.040
left au top, width na

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:54.860
height pia zitabadilika. Kwa hiyo mambo

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:57.430
yanaanza kuhusiana. Na

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:00.960
turubai je? Hiyo ni 100 sasa. Lakini vipi

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:03.700
ikiwa turubai yetu inabadilika kuwa 200 kwa upana

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:06.540
na kwa urefu badala yake? Basi, labda tunapaswa kuweka

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.560
variable inayoitwa canvasSize na kuiweka

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:13.230
kuwa 100. Na sasa left yetu ni, samahani,

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:17.740
width yetu ni canvasSize toa left mara mbili,

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:22.160
na height yetu ni canvasSize toa top mara

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:26.120
mbili. Hebu tufikiri Jiki anafanya nini

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:30.580
tunapoandika let height sawa na canvasSize toa

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:33.310
top mara mbili. Basi, anaanza kwa kuchukua

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:35.220
sanduku la top kutoka rafuni, na

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:37.660
anapata 20 ndani yake, na anatoa

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:40.160
kikokotoo chake cha mfukoni na kufanya 20 mara mbili,

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:42.740
na anajiwekea akilini 40.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:45.860
Na kisha anachukua sanduku la canvasSize

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:49.540
kutoka rafuni, anapata 100 ndani yake, na

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:52.780
anagundua kuwa 100 toa 40 ni 60.

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:56.350
Na sasa anajua kwamba kwa kweli tunachosema

00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:00.000
ni let height sawa na 60. Kwa hiyo anafuata

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:02.320
ile let, akichukua sanduku jipya na kuandika

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:04.440
height juu yake, kisha anaweka 60

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.900
ndani yake. Na baadaye anapotumia height,

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:09.600
anatoa tu ile 60

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:13.720
tena. Jaribu kutumia haya yote katika

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:16.180
mazoezi machache yajayo na yatakuwa

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:18.649
wazi zaidi na zaidi. Na pia, mara tu kila kitu

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:22.070
kinapofanya kazi, jaribu kubadilisha thamani za

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:25.200
variable na uone kinachotokea. Angalia jinsi

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:28.420
zinavyokua na jinsi zinavyopungua. Chukua

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:31.480
muda wako, fikiri kuhusu uhusiano kati ya mambo, na

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.670
tutaonana hapa tena hivi punde.
